Backport WebSocket continuation draining from Drogon PR #2320:
https://github.com/drogonframework/drogon/commit/26e7c6913ce148d0ca42c42ccd446ed9a47d765b

Also backport parser control/data state separation and continuation validation
from PR #2659, without its unrelated framework changes or UTF-8 helper dependency:
https://github.com/drogonframework/drogon/commit/33f7b0ebd6247a2478b95ac9f370803a3a55cf8c

A complete non-final fragment must not strand already-buffered continuations.
Ping/pong frames between fragments must not consume or change the data message.
Retain the upstream copyright and license in the patched source. Remove this
patch when upgrading to a release containing both fixes.

